# Dynamic Flanges and Fittings: Website README

Static website (plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript, no build step) for **Dynamic Flanges and Fittings**, MS flange manufacturer and supplier, Darukhana, Mumbai.

Upload the whole `site` folder to your hosting and keep the folder structure as it is.

---

## 1. Folder structure

```
site/
├── index.html            Home (target: MS flange manufacturer and supplier in Mumbai)
├── products.html         All products (3 categories, MS vs SS table)
├── flanges.html          MS flanges: types, Class 150/300/600 tables, process
├── fittings.html         Pipe fittings: types, dimension tables, schedules
├── pipes.html            MS pipes: types, schedule and IS 1239 tables
├── about.html            About us
├── certification.html    Udyam, GST, ISO, IEC certificates, MTC, inspection
├── contact.html          Contact details, enquiry form, map
├── robots.txt            Crawler rules and sitemap link
├── sitemap.xml           8 URLs
├── llms.txt              Short summary for AI search tools
├── css/style.css         All shared styling (header, footer, cards, tables)
├── js/
│   ├── products.js       Product data (names, icons, descriptions)
│   └── main.js           Menu, icons, carousel, enquiry form
└── images/
    ├── logo.png
    ├── ms-flanges-image.png / ms-fittings-image.png / ms-pipes-image.png
    └── certificates/     (add your certificate images here)
```

Favicon files are in the separate `favicon/` folder (see section 6).

---

## 2. Images you must add

| File | Used on | Recommended size |
|---|---|---|
| `images/ms-flanges-hero.png` | flanges.html top banner | about 1600 × 640 |
| `images/ms-fittings-hero.png` | fittings.html top banner | about 1600 × 640 |
| `images/ms-pipes-hero.png` | pipes.html top banner | about 1600 × 640 |
| `images/certificates/udyam-registration-certificate.png` | certification.html | portrait, about 900 × 1200 |
| `images/certificates/gst-registration-certificate.png` | certification.html | portrait, about 900 × 1200 |
| `images/certificates/iso-certificate.png` | certification.html | portrait, about 900 × 1200 |
| `images/certificates/iec-certificate.png` | certification.html | portrait, about 900 × 1200 |

- Until the hero images exist, each page falls back to its `ms-*-image.png`, which looks soft when stretched.
- **Before uploading certificates, blur or mask the PAN, bank details, Aadhaar and QR codes.**
- Keep file names exactly as above, or edit the paths in the HTML.
- Add an Open Graph image (about 1200 × 630) if you want rich link previews.

