## 3. Things to fix or confirm before going live

### Must fix
1. **Old phone number.** The correct number is **+91 98920 65723**. The old number `8433507898` is still in:
   - `index.html` (11 places)
   - `js/main.js` (line 83): **the enquiry form opens WhatsApp to the old number**
   - `llms.txt`
2. **Manufacturer vs supplier wording.** Fittings and pipes pages say you *supply* them and *manufacture* only flanges. These still say fittings and pipes are *made at our Darukhana factory* (footer text appears on every page):
   - the footer on all 8 pages
   - parts of `index.html`, `products.html` and `about.html`
   Make these consistent with what you really do. Mixed claims can hurt trust and rankings.

### Confirm (marked with `CONFIRM` or `VERIFY` comments in the HTML)
- **Dimension tables** (flanges, fittings, pipes): values follow ASME B16.5, B16.9, B36.10 and IS 1239 style tables. Check them against the current standards or your own drawings.
- **Products you offer:** the "Also ask us about" lists (socket weld, orifice, forged and so on), and the fittings and pipe types.
- **Supply and process steps:** sourcing, inspection and flange manufacturing steps.
- **Industries served:** the "Industries we serve" box.
- **Classes you make:** Class 150, 300 and 600 flanges.
- **Service areas:** Navi Mumbai, Thane, Pune, Maharashtra and other states.
- **ISO and IEC:** these belong to the parent company. Add the parent company name, ISO standard, certifying body and validity date on the certification page.
- **Missing facts:** year established, machinery, capacity and business hours (HTML comments mark the spots on about.html and contact.html).

Search the project for `CONFIRM`, `VERIFY` and `OWNER` to find every place.

---

## 4. How to edit common things

| Task | Where |
|---|---|
| Phone, email, address | Every HTML page (top bar, footer, floating buttons) and `js/main.js` (form), `llms.txt` |
| Colours and fonts | `css/style.css`, `:root` variables at the top |
| Home and products category cards | Static HTML in `index.html` and `products.html` |
| Contact form product list | `js/products.js` (fills the dropdown) |
| FAQ text | Visible FAQ **and** the matching FAQPage JSON-LD in the same file. Keep the two identical. |
| Page title, description, canonical | Each page's `<head>` |

The header, footer and top bar are repeated on each page, so a change to the menu or footer must be made in all 8 HTML files.

---

## 5. SEO setup

Each page has a unique title, meta description, canonical link, Open Graph and Twitter tags, one H1, structured data (JSON-LD), breadcrumbs and internal links.

| Page | Main keyword focus |
|---|---|
| index.html | MS flange manufacturer and supplier in Mumbai |
| flanges.html | MS flanges manufacturer in Mumbai, Class 150/300/600 |
| fittings.html | MS pipe fittings supplier in Mumbai, sizes and schedules |
| pipes.html | MS pipes supplier in Mumbai, ERW, seamless, schedules |
| products.html | Industrial flanges and fittings manufacturer in Mumbai |
| certification.html | Industrial flange quality certification |
| about.html | MS flanges manufacturing company in Mumbai |
| contact.html | MS flanges supplier contact in Mumbai |

**After launch**
1. Submit `https://dynamicflangesandfittings.com/sitemap.xml` in Google Search Console and Bing Webmaster Tools.
2. Check the structured data with Google's Rich Results Test.
3. Run PageSpeed Insights on the home page and the flanges page.
4. Claim and complete the Google Business Profile with the Darukhana address, categories and photos, and keep name, address and phone the same everywhere.
5. List the business on IndiaMART and TradeIndia with the same details and a link to the site.
6. Collect genuine customer reviews.
7. Update `lastmod` dates in `sitemap.xml` when pages change.

**Ideas for more pages (search data shows demand):** Table E flange dimensions, IS 1538 flange dimensions, and city pages such as Pune, Thane and Navi Mumbai.

No one can guarantee a first-position ranking. Rankings also depend on backlinks, reviews, your Google Business Profile and how competitors respond.

---

## 6. Favicon

Files are in `favicon/`: `favicon.svg`, `favicon.ico`, `favicon-48x48.png`, `favicon-96x96.png`, `apple-touch-icon.png`, `icon-192.png`, `icon-512.png`.

Upload them to the site root, then replace the old emoji favicon line in each page's `<head>` with:

```html
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="48x48" href="/favicon-48x48.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#073B75">
```

---

## 7. Testing checklist

- [ ] Open all 8 pages; check the menu on desktop and on a phone.
- [ ] Footer looks right at 360 px width.
- [ ] Contact form: submit a test enquiry, confirm WhatsApp opens with the **new** number.
- [ ] "Request quote" buttons pre-select the product on the contact page.
- [ ] Dimension table tabs work on flanges, fittings and pipes pages.
- [ ] Certificate images open large when clicked.
- [ ] Hero and carousel images load and are not stretched.
- [ ] No broken links, and `robots.txt` and `sitemap.xml` open in the browser.
- [ ] Rich Results Test shows no errors.

